SUMMARY:Country 102.5's Acoustic Christmas
LOCATION:Roadrunner\, 89 Guest St\, Boston\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:with ft. Cole Swindell\, Chase Matthew\, Scotty McCreery\, and 
 Jackson Dean\nJoin Country 102.5 for a special acoustic evening featuring 
 country superstars Cole Swindell\, Scotty McCreery\, Chase Matthew\, and J
 ackson Dean - December 7 at Roadrunner in Boston. Experience intimate perf
 ormances\, unforgettable stories\, and stripped-down sets from some of cou
 ntry music's biggest stars in a unique setting at one of Boston's best con
 cert venues. A portion of ticket proceeds will benefit Christmas in the Ci
 ty\, a nonprofit organization dedicated to helping Boston-area families ex
 periencing homelessness and poverty. Through year-round programs and holid
 ay initiatives\, the organization works to ensure that every child can exp
 erience the magic of the season\, regardless of their family's financial c
 ircumstances. Come together with Country 102.5 for an unforgettable night 
 of music\, community\, and giving back. Enjoy performances from your favor
 ite country artists while helping make a meaningful difference for local f
 amilies this holiday season.\nhttps://www.axs.com/events/1662612/country-1
 02-5-s-acoustic-christmas-tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.ci
 ty/boston/
URL:https://www.axs.com/events/1662612/country-102-5-s-acoustic-christmas-t
 ickets
